lab-claude's mail configs ship in its jail's dist, but nothing said
what else a working client needs, or in what order. Pat, setting it
up, found no docs for it. The README now gives the steps from the
installed configs to lab-process-mail, and none needs a password.

bootstrap.sh, one of those steps, now makes the list's folders as
well as the mail root, since mbsync dumped core on beastie on a first
sync into folders that did not exist.
